ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Lo importante son las {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}plumas{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Tienes que agarrar las plumas
que flotan por ahí!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Hay muchas de colores distintos,
así que es un poco caótico{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
¡Pero tú coge tantas como puedas!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oggi ci divertiamo con le {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}piume{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Devi raccogliere quelle che
cadono qua e là!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ce ne sono di vari colori
ed è facile confondersi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ma prendine più che puoi!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}È da squinternati rifiutarsi
di ballare nel giorno di Carnevale!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hai mangiato qualcosa prima di
venire?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Ti serviranno energie oggi!

{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Buondì!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Finalmente è {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Carnevale{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hai fatto una bella colazione?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ti servirà un bel po' di energia{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
per ballare tutto il giorno!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Chi resta in piedi fino alla fine
della giornata vince! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}El sol está en lo más alto, 
animándonos para que bailemos{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
¡Porque en Carnaval hay que bailar!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Nos queda todo el día por delante!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡No te canses tan pronto,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Le carnaval bat son plein, et l'soleil
est d'la partie !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}La fête est loin d'être terminée,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
alors garde des réserves !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

{{TAG:0003:0023:}}C'est pas la teuf tous les jours,
alors pas question d'en perdre une
miette,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Te relâche pas !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Interdiction de s'reposer avant la fin
du carnaval !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Things are pretty wild outside, huh?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I need to get back out there soon!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Draußen geht's voll ab, was?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ich muss so schnell wie möglich
zurück zur Party! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Puh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ist ja schon ganz schön spät!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Keine Müdigkeit vortäuschen,{{TAG:0003:0000:}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}es
wird bis zum Morgengrauen getanzt!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}OK, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Facciamo un gioco!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}La posta in gioco sono le nostre
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}piume{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}. {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Se vinci tu, ti prendi la mia.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Se vinco io {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}me ne prendo una tua!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Vuoi giocare?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
